    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 5 60]\ntheorem green_39.variant_101 : answer(sorry) ↔\n    Tendsto\n      (fun p : {q : ℕ // q.Prime} ↦\n        let k := Nat.sqrt p\n        let c := ⌊1.01 * (k : ℝ)⌋₊\n        (proportionCoverable p k c : ℝ))\n      atTop (𝓝 1)",
